idx":null,"text":"儘管身體還發著燒，但不想錯過比賽，決定帶病上場","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"練球後覺得身體疲憊，主動伸展放鬆並增加睡眠時間","n":23,"ssz":"....1.................."},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（十一     )開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":93,"ssz":"....................................................................1...1...1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit_row[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.judge_signature_line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判簽名:","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.performance_tiers.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.performance_tiers.tiers[0].range","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"□ ＜190字","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:key_reading.performance_tiers.tiers[1].range","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"□ 191~220字","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:key_reading.performance_tiers.tiers[2].range","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"□ ＞221字","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:key_reading.performance_tiers.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生自填，原稿三個□都沒有勾選","n":15,"ssz":"........1......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「哦！阿哲也來啦！」教練一邊準備貼紮的用具，一邊","n":24,"ssz":"............2.........2."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看完阿哲的故事，我們也可以回到自己的日常想一想──我們，真的有「顧好身體」嗎？在成為身體的好夥伴之前，就像交新朋友一樣，我們可以先帶著好奇的眼光去認識他。透過觀察、體驗與小小的練習，讓我們一起傾聽身體的聲音，一起更認識這位默默陪著你的好夥伴，也更了解適合自己的放鬆和休息方式。","n":138,"ssz":".....................2...................................1.........1..........................2.........2..................1........1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎小試身手：\n練習一：身體有些小習慣、小動作是我們平常沒有發覺的，請根據題目觀察看看，並記錄下來。","n":49,"ssz":"................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎小試身手：","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"練習一：身體有些小習慣、小動作是我們平常沒有發覺的，請根據題目觀察看看，並記錄下來。","n":42,"ssz":".........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雙手交叉放在胸前，哪一隻手臂在外側？","n":18,"ssz":"..........2......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"右手","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"左手","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生自填，原稿無勾選","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"翹腳坐著，通常是哪一腳在上方？","n":15,"ssz":".........2....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"右腳","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"左腳","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"聳肩時，哪邊比較容易抬高？","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"右肩","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"左肩","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一樣容易","n":4,"ssz":"1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"輕輕轉頭看右邊、再看左邊，哪一邊轉得比較順？","n":22,"ssz":"..............2..1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"右邊","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"左邊","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一樣順","n":3,"ssz":"1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雙腳自然放地面，感覺哪一隻腳踩得比較實？","n":20,"ssz":"...........2...1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一樣踏實","n":4,"ssz":"1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"感受一下臀部與椅子接觸的感覺，觀察身體重量放在哪一邊比較多？","n":30,"ssz":"..1.....1...............2....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"右半邊","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"左半邊","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一樣多","n":3,"ssz":"1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"※好奇的眼光是重新認識身體的第一步，用一句話寫下你對身體的發現與觀察吧！\n例如：我發現原來我的身體重心很常放在右邊\n→我發現，原來______________________________________________","n":111,"ssz":".1.....1...........1..........................................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"※好奇的眼光是重新認識身體的第一步，用一句話寫下你對身體的發現與觀察吧！","n":36,"ssz":".1.....1...........1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例如：我發現原來我的身體重心很常放在右邊","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→我發現，原來______________________________________________","n":53,"ssz":"....................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生自填，原稿橫線是空的","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"練習二：在生活中，你都如何讓身體放鬆和休息呢？根據以下題目找出適合自己的方法。（可複選）","n":44,"ssz":"..................1........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.當身體覺得「累」的時候，我最想──","n":19,"ssz":"......1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"躺下來或靠著椅背閉眼休息","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"喝幾口水","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"慢慢伸展或轉動肩膀、手、腳","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"深呼吸幾次，讓身體放慢節奏","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讓身體靜止不動幾分鐘","n":10,"ssz":".....1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.6","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"其他：＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"原稿排成兩欄，左欄③④、右欄⑤⑥，依左到右閱讀會讀成 ③⑤④⑥（見 E3）；此處按編號排序","n":45,"ssz":".......................................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.當身體某個地方「卡卡的」或覺得緊繃時，我會──","n":25,"ssz":"......1.........1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"起身走一走或換個姿勢","n":10,"ssz":"...2...1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.2","slu